### ⚠️ LIMITATIONS

- **No real 3D** — uses 2D canvas with pseudo-3D angles.
- **No server** — NPCs and vehicles are procedural, not networked.
- **No save** — state resets on reload.
- **No audio** — no sound system.
- **No inventory / weapons** — single weapon type.
- **No dialogue / cutscenes** — mission text only.

