- Drag-and-drop or file input for audio upload.
- Real-time waveform rendering using `Web Audio API`.
- Click on waveform to add/edit labels (start/end time).
- Edit labels via inline text boxes.
- Delete labels.
- Export labels as JSON.
- Import JSON labels (optional).
- Responsive UI.

