- Upload multiple `.mp4` / `.mov` / `.webm` video and `.mp3` / `.wav` audio files
- Drag clips onto the timeline to arrange them (video clips can have audio tracks)
- Drag clips between lanes (video/audio lanes)
- Visual timeline with playhead, duration, and clip indicators
- Export final video with audio mixed in

