### A. Markdown Editor
- Monaco Editor (code-like markdown)
- Live preview (marked.js)
- Syntax highlighting for code blocks
- Auto-save every 3s
- Version history UI

### B. API Documentation Generator
- Upload OpenAPI/Swagger JSON/YAML
- Parse → generate Markdown + HTML table
- Auto-detect endpoints, parameters, responses
- Export to PDF/HTML

### C. Version Management
- Compare two versions
- Revert to any version
