## 🧩 Core Features

### 1. Variable Interpolation
Supports `{name}`, `{subject}`, `{company}`, `{date}`, `{cta}`, `{product}`, `{price}`, `{discount}`, `{link}`, `{tracking_id}`, `{utm_source}`, `{utm_medium}`, `{utm_campaign}`.

### 2. Conditional Logic
Use `<!-- if: condition --> ... <!-- end -->` or `<!-- if: condition --> ... <!-- else --> ... <!-- end -->` blocks.

### 3. A/B Testing
Generate two variants (A & B) from a single template with a single click. Each variant gets a unique `variant_id` and `variant_name`.

### 4. Visual Editor
WYSIWYG-like editor with drag-and-drop blocks (Headline, Body, Button, Image, Divider, Social Proof, Testimonial, Footer). Live preview.

### 5. Sending Record Tracking
Track every send: `timestamp`, `recipient`, `status` (sent/delivered/opened/clicked/bounced/unsubscribed), `variant`, `subject`, `template_id`.

### 6. Open Rate Statistics
Per-template, per-variant, per-day. Chart displays: line chart (open rate over days), bar chart (sent vs delivered vs opened vs clicked), pie chart (status breakdown).

